# Gives Code Monkey sessions on this repository sudo and Docker
# (lfreleng-actions/github-code-monkey-bot, docs/DESIGN.md section 4.1).
# Only this file's presence at the root of the default branch counts;
# the bot never reads its content.
#
# Why: this action builds CSIT lab nodes from docker/Dockerfile.node
# and brings the lab up as containers on a private Docker network
# (scripts/lab-up-docker.sh). A change to the lab cannot be checked
# unless the session can build and run containers.
